 1AEB   0008    '----- gate point in the shared region of adjacent boxes i,j = 
                the average of the
 1AEB   0008    '----- corners of one lying inside the other + the edge-edge cr
                ossings (all such
 1AEB   0008    '----- points lie in i AND j, so their average is a point in i 
                n j to walk through)
 1AEB   0008    SUB GateOf (bxa%(), i%, j%, gx!, gy!)
 1AF6   0008            oi% = 1 + i% * 8: oj% = 1 + j% * 8
 1AF6   0008            sxg! = 0: syg! = 0: cg% = 0
 1AF6   0008            FOR e% = 0 TO 3
 1B34   0008                    pcx! = bxa%(oi% + e% * 2): pcy! = bxa%(oi% + e%
