                . Off-floor goal is
 1F72   0008    '----- snapped onto the nearest box; no boxes or no path = a si
                ngle straight leg.
 1F72   0008    SUB FindPath (sx!, sy!, gx!, gy!, bxa%(), wpx!(), wpy!(), wpn%)
 1F7D   0008            nb% = bxa%(0)
